     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-native-american-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-native-american-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-native-american-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\" title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. When building this specification, the most recent version 1.3 has been used\"> version ⏿1.3</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-1010-8\">1010-8</a></td><td>Apache</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-4111-1\">4111-1</a></td><td>Aztec</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-1035-5\">1035-5</a></td><td>Blackfeet</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-1088-4\">1088-4</a></td><td>Cherokee</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-1102-3\">1102-3</a></td><td>Cheyenne</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-1123-9\">1123-9</a></td><td>Chippewa</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-1155-1\">1155-1</a></td><td>Choctaw</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-3109-6\">3109-6</a></td><td>Comanche</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-3745-7\">3745-7</a></td><td>Inupiat</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-1340-9\">1340-9</a></td><td>Lumbee</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-1833-3\">1833-3</a></td><td>Lingít (Tlingit)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-4093-1\">4093-1</a></td><td>Mayan</td></tr><tr><td><a